      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Test with pinned data\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEnable both nodes above and set a Drive file, or pin one of these on **Set Default Extraction**:\n\n**URL Input:**\n```json\n{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/N8n\"}\n```\n\n**Binary Input:**\n```json\n{\n  \"binary_files\": {\n    \"attachment_0\": {\n      \"mimeType\": \"image/jpeg\",\n      \"data\": \"base64...\",\n      \"fileName\": \"test.jpg\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```",
